{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1422895-instinctual-conversation-questions","id":1422895,"title":"Instinctual Conversation questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-10T04:45:08-08:00","id":1422895,"title":"Instinctual Conversation questions","content":"Two questions about this Brood Manifestation.<br /> <br /> - after enacting it, is it permanent? All the other Manifestations specifically list a duration, but not this one. I'm inclined to say yes, because it would seem to be the 2E version of Tongue of the Beast<br /> <br /> - in the write up, it mentions 'a Bestial Condition'. Is this a typo, and was it meant to say something like 'a Triadic Condition'? Or was it meant to say 'the Bestial Condition', which would make it possible with that one specific Condition? Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-17T17:12:49-08:00","id":1424629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PJ123</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1422895-instinctual-conversation-questions#post1422895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Two questions about this Brood Manifestation.<br /> <br /> - after enacting it, is it permanent? All the other Manifestations specifically list a duration, but not this one. I'm inclined to say yes, because it would seem to be the 2E version of Tongue of the Beast</div> </div> </div> </div>Check if you have the final version of the PDF, because my copy ends the description of the power with &quot;This Manifestation lasts for one scene.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> - in the write up, it mentions 'a Bestial Condition'. Is this a typo, and was it meant to say something like 'a Triadic Condition'? Or was it meant to say 'the Bestial Condition', which would make it possible with that one specific Condition? Thanks. </div> </div> </div>It can probably be safely assumed that it means the three Conditions imposed by the Predatory Aura, Detachment rolls, and/or being part of the Brood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-18T03:24:09-08:00","id":1424674,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the clarification. One scene... I guess that's okay. I'm with you on it being used for any of those three Conditions. Makes more sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https:/